# star.turtle -- a pentagram's cousin: eight points, then a stride across it.
#
# The `pen up` / `forward 10` / `pen down` in the middle is a pen-up MOVE: the
# turtle travels 10 units and nothing is drawn, but the view is fitted to where
# it went, so the stride still counts towards the bounding box.

colour green
repeat 8 [ forward 40  right 135  forward 40  right 135 ]

pen up
forward 10
pen down

colour cyan
repeat 8 [ forward 20  right 90  forward 20  right 90 ]
